  "text": "BluePearl Pet Hospital | Peoria Glendale, AZ\nSkip to the content\nJoin the BluePearl Family!\nWe're hiring.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Peoria, AZ\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nPeoria\nGlendale, AZ\n24/7 Emergency and Specialty\n623.974.1520\n20165 N 67th Ave. Ste. 118\nGlendale, AZ 85308\n[email protected]\ninstagram.com/bluepearlpeoria\nEmergency:\n24/7\nSpecialty:\nSun-Fri: 8 am-5 pm\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nBluePearl Pet Hospital – serving Northwest Phoenix.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital is open around the clock every day to provide urgent medical care for pets in the communities of Peoria, Sun City, Youngtown, Surprise and Glendale.\nOur reviews.\nOur services.\nWhen your pet needs emergency care, seconds count. Our team is ready to provide expert care 24/7 in case of a pet emergency. If your pet requires a veterinary specialist, we are ready for that too. Our experienced team of veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff work closely together to provide the comprehensive, compassionate care your pet needs and deserves.\nEmergency\nWe’re here when your pet’s primary veterinarian’s office is closed. Always staffed with trained clinicians, BluePearl Pet Hospital in Peoria is open 24 hours for pet emergencies. It’s our goal to provide the compassionate, comprehensive medical care your pet deserves while maintaining close communication with you through every step of the process.\nAs experts in emergency medicine, our clinicians are prepared for any pet emergency that may walk through the door. Common emergencies we diagnose and treat include:\nVomiting and diarrhea\nTrauma and hit-by-car accidents\nSeizures\nToxicities\nSudden complications from a chronic disease\nBloat (gastric dilatation volvulus, or GDV)\nIn the event of an emergency, please call ahead and let us know you’re coming. There is no appointment necessary for your emergency vet visit.\nSpecialty care\nOur veterinary specialists work directly with your primary care vet to understand your pet’s condition and develop the appropriate treatment plan. Visits to our specialists are usually by referral from your primary care vet and by appointment.\nLearn more about veterinary specialists\n.\nSee Specialties and Services\nOur\nveterinarians.\nCaring for your pets is our passion. Meet our team of veterinary specialists here to help you and your pet.\nSee Veterinarians\nAbout BluePearl Pet Hospital Peoria.\nServing as the only 24-hour pet hospital in the greater Peoria community, our facility is equipped with advanced diagnostic technology and sophisticated tools to provide the highest quality of care. On-site services include:\nX-ray imaging\nEmergency surgery\nLaboratory testing\nCritical care and overnight hospitalization\nPet owners.\nAt BluePearl Pet Hospitals, providing our customers with remarkable service is a top priority. We’re committed to making your veterinary visit as smooth as possible.\nHave questions prior to your visit? We’re happy to help. Contact our hospital team at\n623.974.1520\nor\n[email protected]\n.\nTestimonials.\n“Dr. McAdam and Aurora were friendly, helpful and, most of all, really really cared about me and my dog Bella. If you ever need to take your animal to a ER, this is the place to take them. Would recommend them to all my family and friends.”\n– Debra P.\n“We brought Tilli in this morning after she accidentally got cactus in her eye. Everyone was absolutely phenomenal from start to finish! We got Tilli home today and it was as if nothing ever happened to her, we can’t thank the staff at BluePearl enough! Amazing job, and we are very grateful for their service. Tilli thanks you too!!”\n– Zachary B.\nCurrent location.\n623.974.1520\n623.974.7738\n20165 N 67th Ave.                                    Ste. 118\nGlendale,\nAZ                                    85308\n[email protected]\nOther hospitals.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nScottsdale, AZ\n22595 N Scottsdale Rd., Ste. 110\nScottsdale, AZ 85255\n480.949.8001\n16.04 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nAvondale, AZ\n13034 W Rancho Santa Fe Blvd., Ste. 101\nAvondale, AZ 85392\n623.385.4555\n16.05 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nIrvine, CA\n1371 Reynolds Ave.\nIrvine, CA 92614\n949.833.9020\n325.00 miles\nGet In Touch\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\n2950 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa\n, FL\n33614\nContact Us\nFind a Hospital Near Me\nCareers at BluePearl\nBluePearl™ Cares\nWeb Accessibility\nYour Privacy Choices\nStay Connected\nHere for pets.\nWhen it matters most.\nStay connected with BluePearl for expert advice, helpful tips and trusted information to support you and your pet - delivered straight to your inbox.\nSign Up\ncookies notice\nprivacy policy\nlegal\nad choices\nterms & conditions\naccessibility\ncontact us\na\nbrand\n© 2026 BluePearl Holdings LLC. All rights reserved.\nCookie Settings",
